---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import SpotlightImage from '../../components/SpotlightImage.astro';
---
<MainLayout 
  title="Technical SEO Audits Orange County CA | OCWebPros" 
  description="Full-site technical SEO audits for Orange County businesses. We find crawl errors, Core Web Vitals failures, indexing problems, and schema gaps - then deliver a prioritized fix plan."
  bodyClass="page-services page-technical-seo-audits"
  pageCSS="/css/pages/services.css">

  <header class="relative pt-32 sm:pt-32 md:pt-40 pb-12 sm:pb-16 px-4 sm:px-6 text-center overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[90vw] max-w-[800px] h-[400px] sm:h-[500px] md:h-[600px] glow-bg pointer-events-none opacity-40"></div>
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto relative">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 text-xs font-medium text-orange-400 mb-6">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 animate-pulse"></span>
        Technical SEO Audits
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-4">
        Technical SEO Audits for <span class="text-gradient-orange">Orange County</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        We crawl your entire website to uncover the technical problems quietly holding back your rankings - slow pages, crawl errors, broken links, indexing issues, and missing schema - then hand you a prioritized fix plan in plain English.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center mt-8">
        <a href="/contact/" class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-orange-700 text-white font-semibold rounded-full hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors btn-glow text-sm md:text-base">
          Request an Audit
        </a>
        <a href="/pricing/" class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-semibold rounded-full border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors text-sm md:text-base">
          View Pricing
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="pb-16 sm:pb-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8">
    <!-- Spotlight -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-8 md:pt-12 pb-16 md:pb-24 px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 md:gap-12">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 backdrop-blur-[12px] bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10" data-aos="fade-right">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-slate-100 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900">Find What's Holding Your Site Back</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">Great content can't rank on a broken foundation. Our audits combine a full crawl, Search Console data, and Core Web Vitals testing to surface every issue Google sees - ranked by how much each one actually matters for your rankings and revenue.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-700">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Full-site crawl covering every page, redirect, and broken link</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Core Web Vitals and page speed testing on real devices</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Indexation review - what's in Google, what's missing, and why</span></li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-500 flex-shrink-0"></span><span>Prioritized fix list ordered by ranking impact, not alphabetically</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <SpotlightImage
          src="/images/unsplash/hosting-infrastructure.jpg"
          alt="Server infrastructure representing technical website health"
        />
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What We Check -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto pt-2 md:pt-4 pb-16 md:pb-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12" data-aos="fade-up">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-2 text-slate-900">What Our Technical Audit Covers</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">Every audit inspects the six areas that most commonly block rankings for local business websites - and every finding comes with a recommended fix.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="0">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Crawlability &amp; Indexation</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Robots.txt, XML sitemaps, canonical tags, and noindex issues - we verify Google can find and index every page that should rank, and nothing that shouldn't.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Core Web Vitals &amp; Speed</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">LCP, INP, and CLS measured against Google's thresholds, plus the specific scripts, images, and render-blocking resources dragging your scores down.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 005.656 0l4-4a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Broken Links &amp; Redirects</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">404 errors, redirect chains, and orphaned pages that waste crawl budget and leak link equity - mapped and queued for cleanup.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Structured Data &amp; Schema</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Validation of LocalBusiness, Service, FAQ, and review schema - the markup that powers rich results and helps AI search understand your business.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Mobile Experience</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Google indexes the mobile version of your site first. We check viewport setup, tap targets, font sizing, and layout stability on real phone screens.</p>
        </div>
        <div data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="500">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Security &amp; Site Health</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">HTTPS configuration, mixed content warnings, duplicate content, and hosting-level issues that erode trust with both Google and your visitors.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Process -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto py-16 md:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8 bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-100">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-12 text-center" data-aos="fade-up">Our Audit Process</h2>
      <div class="hidden md:flex items-center justify-between relative">
        <div class="absolute top-6 left-0 right-0 h-0.5 bg-orange-500/30 -z-10"></div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 relative group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="0">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">1</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-center group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Crawl &amp; Collect</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-center max-w-[180px]">Full-site crawl plus Search Console and analytics data.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 relative group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="150">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">2</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-center group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Diagnose</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-center max-w-[180px]">Separate critical ranking blockers from minor housekeeping.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 relative group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">3</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-center group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Report</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-center max-w-[180px]">Plain-English findings with a prioritized fix roadmap.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center flex-1 relative group" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="450">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-4 relative z-10 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">4</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2 text-center group-hover:text-orange-400 transition-colors">Fix &amp; Verify</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 text-center max-w-[180px]">We implement the fixes or guide your team, then re-test.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="md:hidden space-y-8">
        <div class="flex gap-4 relative">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">1</div>
            <div class="w-0.5 h-full bg-orange-500/30 mt-2 absolute top-12 left-6"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Crawl &amp; Collect</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Full-site crawl plus Search Console and analytics data.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 relative">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">2</div>
            <div class="w-0.5 h-full bg-orange-500/30 mt-2 absolute top-12 left-6"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Diagnose</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Separate critical ranking blockers from minor housekeeping.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4 relative">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">3</div>
            <div class="w-0.5 h-full bg-orange-500/30 mt-2 absolute top-12 left-6"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Report</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Plain-English findings with a prioritized fix roadmap.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-slate-50 border-2 border-orange-500 text-orange-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">4</div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 pt-2">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Fix &amp; Verify</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600">We implement the fixes or guide your team, then re-test.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Related -->
    <section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto py-16 md:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="backdrop-blur-[12px] bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8" data-aos="fade-up">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">After the Audit: On-Page SEO</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Once the technical foundation is clean, the next lever is your page content - titles, headings, internal links, and copy tuned to the keywords that matter.</p>
          <a href="/services/on-page-seo/" class="text-sm text-orange-400 font-medium hover:text-orange-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Explore on-page SEO optimization
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="backdrop-blur-[12px] bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Ongoing Technical Monitoring</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Technical health isn't one-and-done. Every monthly SEO plan includes crawl error monitoring, index checks, and broken link fixes so issues never pile up again.</p>
          <a href="/services/local-seo/" class="text-sm text-orange-400 font-medium hover:text-orange-300 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            See our monthly SEO plans
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <div class="text-center py-12 sm:py-16 md:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-8" data-aos="fade-up">
      <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900">Wondering why your site isn't ranking?</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-600 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">Request a technical SEO audit and get a clear, prioritized picture of what's blocking your visibility - and exactly what to fix first.</p>
      <div class="inline-flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
        <a href="/contact/" class="px-10 py-5 bg-orange-700 text-white font-bold rounded-full hover:bg-orange-600 transition-colors text-lg btn-glow">
          Request an audit
        </a>
        <a href="/pricing/" class="px-10 py-5 bg-slate-100 text-slate-900 font-bold rounded-full border border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors text-lg">
          View all pricing
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm mt-3">Prefer a call? Add your number in the email.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
